{"additions":11508,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","is_bot":false,"login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"},"baseRefName":"develop","body":"Initial version of a browser-friendly version of `smolmix`, containing a pure-rust version of `mixFetch` and also `mixWebSocket` + `mixResolve` (DNS) features. \r\n- Leverages all of the experiments we've been running over the past year+ and smushes them into a new WASM swiss-army-knife-thing :) \r\n- Had to do some feature-gating to get some of the dependencies to compile. \r\n- Also added in `playwright` headless testing so we can hook this up to the CI (useful format to take forward to smoketest for breaking changes to WASM targets) + I think we can do cool stuff with this in the future, like deploy a modified version of the `internal-dev` UI to a webpage with data on CI runs and timing-averages etc. \r\n- Very unoptimised build, not sure whether we want to work on that in this PR or in a future one. \r\n\r\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\r\n- - -\r\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/nymtech/nym/6784)\r\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Browser WASM networking: mixFetch (HTTP), mixSocket (WebSocket), mixResolve (DNS) over a privacy tunnel; setupMixTunnel / disconnectMixTunnel JS entrypoints and persistent tunnel singleton.\n  * Full in-browser dev UI and headless test runner with Playwright smoke/suite tests.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * New standalone wasm package with build/dev tooling (Makefile, npm/webpack) and README.\n  * Workspace/dependency configuration updates and release-profile tweak for wasm package.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/nymtech/nym/pull/6784?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","changedFiles":55,"commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-04-27T21:29:35Z","authors":[{"email":"maxhampshire@pm.me","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"}],"committedDate":"2026-05-18T07:36:27Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"temp commit","oid":"420d3b62d0e96eb582f8b7bea0120c868c9e8e06"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-28T18:57:04Z","authors":[{"email":"maxhampshire@pm.me","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"}],"committedDate":"2026-05-18T07:37:08Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Gnarly proof of concept","oid":"a3b28aa326bd82604472bab2d50da80d3652d857"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-28T19:07:28Z","authors":[{"email":"maxhampshire@pm.me","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"}],"committedDate":"2026-05-18T07:37:11Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Mod gitignore + license trimming + comment trimming","oid":"0bc680bb7a91bfa0827653f3e368415d0a75274a"},{"authoredDate":"2026-05-12T14:45:44Z","authors":[{"email":"maxhampshire@pm.me","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"}],"committedDate":"2026-05-18T07:37:12Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Big rewrite","oid":"85f9c22db52b9d3a030e6a0688c40acabaae760c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-05-12T14:46:22Z","authors":[{"email":"maxhampshire@pm.me","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"}],"committedDate":"2026-05-18T07:37:13Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"SURB inputs + DNS button in internal-dev","oid":"47b8d995dea478fef5dfd3213b46ca1905150704"},{"authoredDate":"2026-05-12T14:46:46Z","authors":[{"email":"maxhampshire@pm.me","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjYyMjc5","login":"mfahampshire","name":"mfahampshire"}],"committedDate":"2026-05-18T07:37:13Z","me